    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83c\udf1f Google Review Auto-Responder\n\n### What This Workflow Does:\n1. Fetches latest Google Maps reviews via SerpAPI\n2. Filters out already processed reviews\n3. Routes by rating: 5\u2b50 \u2192 Thank You | 1-2\u2b50 \u2192 Apology + Slack Alert\n4. AI generates personalized responses\n5. Logs everything to Google Sheets\n\n### Setup Required:\n- **SerpAPI**: HTTP Query Auth credential (api_key)\n- **OpenAI API**: Your OpenAI API key\n- **Google Sheets**: OAuth2 connection + create tracking sheet\n- **Slack API**: Bot token with chat:write scope\n\n### How to Use:\n1. Fill in the form with your Google Place ID\n2. Enter your business name and Slack channel ID\n3. Run workflow to process reviews\n4. For automation: Replace Form Trigger with Schedule Trigger\n\n### Google Sheets Columns:\nreviewId | rating | reviewerName | reviewText | businessName | generatedResponse | responseType | timestamp",
        "height": 712,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e2983fca-2378-45c2-9f53-fa74d206aba4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1920,
        496
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcdd Note: Auto-Posting Responses\n\nThis workflow DRAFTS responses but does NOT auto-post them to Google.\n\n**Why?**\nGoogle Business Profile API requires OAuth setup and business verification. Most users prefer to review AI responses before posting.\n\n**To enable auto-posting:**\n1. Set up Google Business Profile API\n2. Add HTTP Request node after OpenAI nodes\n3. POST to the reviews reply endpoint\n\nSee docs for details.",
        "height": 412,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "475dd6a5-c06e-4f67-9e68-9856695097d0",
